# The catalog cannot be read at launch (the fake gateway's /models answers 503
# until the `modelsup` line), a turn starts and keeps streaming, and `/model`
# asks again while it runs: fx starts the load on a thread of its own at once
# (`ensureModelCache` from `openModelBrowseCatalog`,
# `app_input_runtime.zig:2346-2349`) and the open menu takes the rows when they
# land (`pollLoadTransition`, `model_cache_runtime.zig:549-557`). The first
# `/model` comes inside the launch failure's 5 s hold and reads nothing
# (`menu-failed`); the catalog is back before the prompt -- at a line, not at
# a moment on the gateway's clock, which each binary's launch reaches at a
# different time (registry #19) -- so the second `/model`, past the hold,
# lists the rows.
models models.json
modelsdown
gateway model-reask-turns.json
wait 2.5
snap start
type /model
key Enter
wait 1
snap menu-failed
key Escape
modelsup
wait 0.5
type say something
key Enter
wait 4
snap turn-running
type /model
key Enter
until shown gpt-6-astra
snap reask-midturn
gwlog
